<section class="core-advantages" id="core-advantages" style="background: url('{{ 'slide7_img0_27.png' | asset_url }}') center/cover no-repeat;">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">三大核心优势，重新定义头皮清洁</h2>
    <div class="advantages-grid">
      <div class="advantage-card">
        <h3>🌿 草本植萃 · 温和净养</h3>
        <p>甄选十余种天然草本植萃，源自苗家古方智慧，清洁的同时养护头皮生态。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="advantage-card">
        <h3>⏳ 45天冷制 · 锁住活性</h3>
        <p>低温冷制工艺，<40℃恒温入模，最大程度保留草本活性成分不流失。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="advantage-card">
        <h3>✅ 5大0添加 · 纯净安心</h3>
        <p>0硅油、0月桂醇、0防腐剂、0硫酸盐、0人工香精，敏感头皮也能放心使用。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.core-advantages { padding: 100px 0; position: relative; }
.core-advantages::before {
  content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0;
  background: rgba(0,0,0,0.5); z-index: 1;
}
.core-advantages .container { position: relative; z-index: 2; }
.core-advantages .section-title { color: #fff; }
.advantages-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
  gap: 28px;
  margin-top: 40px;
}
.advantage-card {
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.95);
  border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 36px 28px;
  text-align: center;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
  transition: transform 0.3s;
}
.advantage-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); }
.advantage-card h3 { font-size: 20px; color: #2d4a2a; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.advantage-card p { font-size: 14px; color: #555; line-height: 1.7; }
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Core Advantages",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Core Advantages" }]
}
{% endschema %}
